# On Controller > Advanced Settings (advancedcontroller.gum). v1.00 rows: X-axis, Y-axis sensitivity, X-axis sensitivity, Zoom, Crouch,
# Swap stick functions, Swap L1 and L2, Swap R1 and R2; 1.14 adds a Motion Sensor row. Row 1 (Y sensitivity) RIGHT changes a value;
# then DOWN x7 to the last row, RIGHT to change it, LEFT back.
key DOWN
sleep 2
key RIGHT
sleep 2.5
mark advanced y-sensitivity changed
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
sleep 1
mark advanced last row
key RIGHT
sleep 3
mark advanced last row changed
key LEFT
sleep 3
mark advanced last row changed back
